WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.400
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.830
Yesterday in my Episode 5 review I asked you
all to submit questions about WTF Crasters,

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.960
Sansa, Arya and The Hound and everything else.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.920
So I picked 10 of them to answer in this video
with 1 bonus question.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:19.650
I also have an epic thank you to deliver.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.949
As I’m posting this video I officially just
hit 200,000 subscribers.

00:00:21.949 --> 00:00:24.180
Thank you everyone for being so awesome.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:29.690
I’ll try to do a special announcement video
this week for all the new stuff I’m working

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.190
on.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:36.379
Also, high fives to Shelly Summers and Matt
Dave, you guys are the random winners from

00:00:36.379 --> 00:00:37.379
this week’s giveaway.

00:00:37.379 --> 00:00:38.719
You win $20 Amazon giftcards.

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:42.000
I’ll contact you on your channels for details.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.139
Next round starts after episode 6.

00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:48.289
If you’re just finding me for the first
time be sure to subscribe to get that video.

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:52.469
So let’s answer some questions, you guys
had a lot of good ones this week.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:55.219
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:55.219 --> 00:00:56.219
Here we go.

00:00:56.219 --> 00:01:01.260
Question 1 - Amour Asks Why did Locke want
Bran, what was he going to do with him?

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.750
If you remember all the way back to the last
time we saw Theon and Ramsay Snow at the Dreadfort.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.410
They told Roose that Bran and Rickon were
still alive.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:12.420
Right now Roose is supposed to rule in the
North.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:17.820
But as long as the Stark children are still
alive, people could rally support behind them.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.420
So Roose sent Locke to capture them so they
could prevent any challenges to their rule.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.440
He was never going to kill him.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.440
Just lock him up like Theon in the Dreadfort.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:28.330
Roose isn’t as vicious as Ramsay, but they
would still have been prisoners.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:32.990
Question 2 - Jessica asks Is Arya’s Direwolf
Nymeria still alive?

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.920
And is she gonna be back in the story?﻿

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:43.880
Nymeria is still alive, but George RR Martin
hasn’t said one way or the other as to a

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.500
reunion with Arya.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:55.560
The show has been changing a lot of things,
but until it’s confirmed, just assume that

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:00.220
Nymeria is running wild between the Riverlands
and Winterfell.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:04.180
Question 3 - Emily Whittle asks How long do
you think Arya and the Hound will stay together?

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.180
(mention needle stabbing)

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:13.569
They really did teas us with Arya’s prayer
and her trying to stab him with Needle.

00:02:13.569 --> 00:02:16.909
I think it says a lot that the blade didn’t
penetrate his armor.

00:02:16.909 --> 00:02:20.980
I think it’s Dave and Dan letting us know
that they’ll be together for a while.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:25.380
I’m all in favor of them staying together
all season, but clearly things can’t go

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:27.340
on like they are now.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:30.810
She definitely hates him and there’s no
way their story is going to get a happy ending

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.870
all nice and clean.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:39.970
I’m just waiting for the rug to get yanked
out from under them in the last couple of

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:40.970
episodes.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:44.829
For all the book readers out there too, I
personally wouldn’t flip out if they changed

00:02:44.829 --> 00:02:46.810
the book plot a lot and did something crazy.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:56.579
Just like with the White Walkers last week.

00:02:56.579 --> 00:03:01.870
Question 4 - Hombrezzz asks What do you think
will happen to Kings Landing because of their

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:03.450
debts?﻿

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:09.060
After I made my review video I saw Mark Gatiss
was in the teaser for episode 6, he’s going

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.560
to answer your question.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:15.049
I think the Bank is going to threaten to fund
Stannis unless the Throne can repay their

00:03:15.049 --> 00:03:16.049
debt.

00:03:16.049 --> 00:03:18.079
Remember a Lannister always pays his debts.

00:03:18.079 --> 00:03:20.590
And right now it looks like the Tyrells are
their only option.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.700
So a bunch of stuff could happen.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:28.359
They could find a way to discredit Mace Tyrell
and Margaery and use that as an excuse to

00:03:28.359 --> 00:03:33.709
seize their assets, or the Tyrells could agree
to pay the crown’s debt in exchange for

00:03:33.709 --> 00:03:37.059
a seat on the Small Council.

00:03:37.059 --> 00:03:42.060
Question 5 - Genesis This asks How come Cercei
was so civil towards Margaery?

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:45.620
I think there’s a couple things going on
in that situation.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:50.450
First she’s still completely mentally and
emotionally fried from Joffrey’s death.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:54.040
And she’s reconciling the reality of his
craziness.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.620
Remember how she talked about how he shocked
her?

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.749
So she doesn’t have the energy to hate right
now.

00:03:58.749 --> 00:04:01.420
She’s just thinking about Tommen’s future.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.930
Which leads to the second big reason she’s
being nice.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.019
She wants Tommen to stay pure like he is now.

00:04:07.019 --> 00:04:11.269
And she knows that he needs more positive
influences in his life.

00:04:11.269 --> 00:04:14.779
Even though according to Littlefinger everyone
in King’s Landing is a liar.

00:04:14.779 --> 00:04:17.910
So she’s trying to appeal to Margaery’s
sense of goodness.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:22.040
Cersei definitely knows what Margaery is capable
of, but given the chance I think Margaery

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.210
is a good person.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.910
Remember how shocked she was when Lady Olenna
explained how she killed Joffrey?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.460
With the help of Littlefinger and Ser Dontos
of course.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:36.070
Question 6 - Yughandhar asks when will we
see Gendry and Yara Greyjoy again?

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:39.910
A lot of you guys have asked me about Gendry
and I’m happy to say he’s still alive.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.210
The show wouldn’t just forget about him
after he rowed away from Dragonstone.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:48.260
It’s possible that they could combine the
Yara Ironborn story with Gendry’s escape.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:50.280
There both on the right side of Westeros.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:53.840
Gendry was originally supposed to row his
way to King’s Landing, but I don’t think

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.040
he’ll make it there.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:00.710
If he runs into Yara and ends up helping them
out, they’ll probably run into Theon and

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.710
Ramsay Snow eventually.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:04.210
Right now that feels like where they’re
taking things.

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.060
But Gendry could always run into Arya again.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.750
She’s also headed in an easterly direction.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.200
Either way, Gendry will be back.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.900
We just don’t know which episode yet.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:15.010
Question 7 - Stephanie Herman (no avatar)
asks Do you think that next season will get

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:18.340
into Winds of Winter stuff because the show
is moving so fast?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:19.910
No I don’t think so.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:23.480
There’s still a ton of Dance With Dragons
stuff I haven’t seen yet.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:26.100
They really have slowed the pace of the story
down.

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:29.150
And think about how short some of Daenerys’
scenes have been.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:31.270
She was barely in this episode.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:37.130
What I do think will happen is that we’ll
get more side tracked white walker type scenes.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:39.570
Like Bran at Crasters.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:43.390
Some of the Directors have already said they
expect more big deviations to come up as the

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:44.990
show gets further along.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.860
So don’t plan on seeing any Winds of Winter
stuff till Season 6 at the earliest.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:56.540
Remember, they’re shooting for 8 seasons.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:01.840
Question 8 - Lexyvil what was the reason for
the Craster’s house plot with Bran, Locke

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.840
and Jon Snow?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.330
I think a lot of things were going on there.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:09.620
First you have Locke, a character that wasn’t
in the books.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:12.890
Then you have Bran, who really isn’t even
in the story.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:17.830
The whole Bran going to find the Weirwood
Tree is part of Dance With Dragons.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:22.910
So they did a Theon thing where they add extra
story to fill the gaps in the timeline.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:26.400
Plus they also had Burn Gorman’s character
and the Night’s Watch Revolt plot they had

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.400
to tie up.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:31.150
So the whole Craster’s House battle was
a way to clean everything up with a nice bow

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.900
on top.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:38.310
Now Bran is back on track, the revolt has
been put down and Jon Snow can worry about

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:44.820
the impending Wildling Attack and Locke a
character not in the original story is taken

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:45.820
care of.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.450
So think of Crasters as a filler story for
a period of time that the books didn’t really

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.450
cover.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.270
Remember sometimes characters don’t appear
in every book.

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:54.030
So the show has to deal with that.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:58.450
Question 9 - RyanBirds asks will ever see
the Brotherhood without Banners again?

00:06:58.450 --> 00:06:59.450
(Brienne)

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.460
The Brotherhood is still in the Riverlands
near the Crossroads.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.460
They haven’t left.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:05.430
And Brienne is headed in that direction with
Podrick looking for Sansa.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:09.220
So if anyone runs into them it will be her.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:13.560
I know everyone keeps asking me about Lady
Stoneheart.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.000
There has been no indication that she’s
going to be on the show.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.870
So I don’t want to talk about her too soon.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:24.620
But just be careful how you mention her in
the comments for people who haven’t read

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.620
the books.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.620
Make sure to post spoiler warnings.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:30.130
Question 10 - Peter Rubin asks How will Braavos
come into the show?

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.190
I think that Mark Gatiss will be the first
real introduction.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.820
Although the Bank has branches in all the
kingdoms of the world.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:38.340
It’s central office is just located in Braavos.

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.370
As for that scene of the Titan from the trailers.

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:43.200
I don’t think they’d put something from
the end of the season in the trailer.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.590
So I’m guessing Stannis or Ser Davos will
go there to get more money.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:52.110
There are scenes from the trailers with them
on a ship together.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:56.230
And they haven’t left Dragonstone yet.

00:07:56.230 --> 00:08:00.530
Bonus Question Curtis Gerdes (no avatar) asks
do you think Daenerys will end up riding one

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.340
of her Dragons eventually?

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.290
I would be super bummed if they didn’t.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.860
They’ve been teasing it enough.

00:08:08.860 --> 00:08:13.660
Because a scene like that would such a huge
payoff, I would bet they save it for the finale.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.640
If they end up doing it.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:19.920
So don’t expect to see that until episode
10.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:23.870
Remember how that final shot in season 3 was
of all those people lifting her into the air.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:29.180
Don’t you think a perfect way to visually
call back to that would be for Drogon to literally

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.820
lift her into the air.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.060
And then bam, slam to black for another year
until season 5 comes.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.349
That’s just my opinion.

00:08:35.349 --> 00:08:38.229
I think that would be the perfect way to end
season 4.

00:08:38.229 --> 00:08:41.810
So thank you so much everyone for sending
me questions.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:47.490
And thank you for just being awesome in general.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:50.760
Like I said I’ll try to make an announcement
video for all the new stuff I’m working

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.580
on right now.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:55.070
My next bonus video will be for Braavos.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:59.180
I’ll just talk about the culture and organizations
like the Faceless Ones and the Iron Bank.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:02.120
Be sure to subscribe to get it if you’re
finding me for the first time!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.400
Right now click here for my review of the
episode and click here to learn more about

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.660
the first war with the White Walkers and the
building of the Wall.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.260
See you guys tomorrow.

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.140
Now I need to give out 200,000 high fives.

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:18.140
So I’ll just leave this up for a second.

